{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05175","headline":"入朝别张燕公 · 梁知微","name":"入朝别张燕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华容佳山水，之子厌承明。\n符竹纡小郡，江湖被德声。\n三年计吏入，路指巴丘城。\n凫舟才结缆，驺驾已相迎。\n别离他乡酒，委曲故人情。\n孤屿早烟薄，长波晚气清。\n辛勤方远骛，胜赏屡难幷。\n回瞻洞庭浦，日暮愁云生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁知微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}